1)Strings are immutable

TYPES OF STRING COMPARISIONS
1)equals():compares content(case sensitive)
            eg:str1.equals(str2)
 2)equalsIgnoreCase():compares content(case insensitive)
             eg:str1.equalsIgnoreCase(str2)
 3)compareTo():
 4)contentEquals():

