 4)substring(int start ,int end):
 5)indexOf(string str):returns first occcurence
 6)lastIndexOf(returns last occurence
 7)toUpperCase();
 8)toLowerCase():
 9)trim()
 10)replace(char old,char new)
 11)split():splits string into array
 12)replaceall():use full very use ful
